\"]},{\"id\":\"SV-01-004\",\"status\":\"unresolved\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/006-verify.json\",\"The quick-fix changed Red-manifested test files but did not update `packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json`. I ran `pnpm run green-verify`; the verify portion passed, then `scripts/check-test-immutability.mjs` failed with hash mismatches for `test/work-execution.test.ts`, `test/messages-read.test.ts`, and `test/cli-process-inspect.test.ts`. The test plan says red manifests are regenerated per chunk, and the script is the repository's guard for that record.\"]}],\"baselineBeforeStory\":290,\"baselineAfterStory\":298,\"openRisks\":[\"Verification finding SV-01-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-01-004 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-01-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-01-004 remains unresolved.\"]},\"cumulativeBaseline\":{\"baselineBeforeCurrentStory\":290,\"expectedAfterCurrentStory\":298,\"latestActualTotal\":298},\"commitReadiness\":{\"state\":\"not-ready\",\"reason\":\"Caller ruling is still required before impl-lead commit.\"},\"openRisks\":[\"Verification finding SV-01-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-01-004 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-01-001 remains unresolved.\",\"Verification finding SV-01-004 remains unresolved.\"]},\"cleanupHandoff\":{\"acceptedRiskItems\":[],\"deferredItems\":[{\"description\":\"`messages.listMessages` and `messages.show` now use the real existing touch-suppression mechanism; no fake adapter or shim was introduced for read purity.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/006-verify.json\",\"`messages.listMessages` and `messages.show` now use the real existing touch-suppression mechanism; no fake adapter or shim was introduced for read purity.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"Bounded listing now resolves the message window before selecting blocks and scopes forms to returned ids; no material fake path was found in that production read path.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/006-verify.json\",\"Bounded listing now resolves the message window before selecting blocks and scopes forms to returned ids; no material fake path was found in that production read path.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null},{\"description\":\"The current production behavior removes read-triggered first-touch catch-up for `listMessages`/`show`; accepting that cross-epic behavior change requires human ruling.\",\"reasoning\":\"Story verifier surfaced a production-path audit note. Verifier outcome, open findings, and explicit story-lead risk decisions determine whether action or caller approval is required.\",\"evidence\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/006-verify.json\",\"The current production behavior removes read-triggered first-touch catch-up for `listMessages`/`show`; accepting that cross-epic behavior change requires human ruling.\"],\"approvalStatus\":\"not-required\",\"approvalSource\":null}],\"cleanupRequired\":true},\"rulingRequest\":{\"id\":\"01-message-read-surface-story-run-001-ruling-023\",\"decisionType\":\"cross-story-contract\",\"question\":\"Should strict read purity for `messages.listMessages` and `messages.show` supersede the prior first-touch recovery expectation that a read can trigger catch-up work?\",\"defaultRecommendation\":\"Yes. Keep `messages.listMessages` and `messages.show` strictly read-only with touch suppression; recovery should require explicit drain/work execution. After that ruling, route a quick-fix to update the stale red manifest and then re-verify.\",\"evidence\":[\"Latest verifier artifact `/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/04-inspection/artifacts/01-message-read-surface/006-verify.json` reports SV-01-001 as `needs-human-ruling` and blocking.\",\"Story requirements include Architecture-Risk Tests for read-only drift and zero-provider behavior on list/show.\",\"Verifier reports `pnpm verify` and `pnpm verify-all` passed after the quick-fix, but `pnpm run green-verify` failed because `packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json` is stale.\",\"SV-01-004 is a fixable red-manifest issue, but SV-01-001 requires a ruling before safe handoff.\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"strict-read-purity-supersedes-first-touch-recovery\",\"first-touch-read-recovery-must-be-preserved\",\"other-explicit-ruling\"]},\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"ask-ruling\"}\n","numLines":2,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2}}}
